Sugrīva tells Rāma monkey lords stationed obedient famed tireless seeking timely command --- Rāma embracing bids learn if Vidēhī lives and find Rāvaṇa country acting together --- Rāma says neither he nor Lakṣmaṇa master thou cause master ordering knowing task --- Sugrīva sends mountain-roaring Vinata with hundred thousand swift east seeking Sītā Rāvaṇa --- Seek rivers Bhāgīrathī Sarayū Kauśikī Yamunā Sindhu lands Vidēha Kōsala Magadha Vaṅga silver-mine --- Seek Mandara iron-face one-foot man-eaters Kirāta isles Yava seven-kingdom Śiśira sky hills --- Seek shadow-seizing asuras Lōhita Kūṭaśālmalī Vainatēya house Mandēhas Kṣīrōda Rṣabha Sudarśana --- Seek Jalōda Vaḍavāmukha Ananta Udaya Saumanasa Viṣṇu stride Vaikhānasa groves returning within month
